    <div class="split__text prose">
      <h2 class="section-title">Working with one craftsman</h2>
      <p>I work on my own, which means the person who visits your home, draws the design, chooses the timber, makes each piece and fits it is the same person throughout. You always know who to speak to, and the ideas we agree at the start are carried right through to the finished room.</p>
      <p>It also means I take on a limited number of projects at a time, so each one gets the attention it deserves. I would rather do fewer jobs well than hurry any of them.</p>
      <p>I use the best timber and fittings I can source, because the furniture I make is meant to be lived with for a long time. Whether you are thinking of a whole kitchen or a single bookcase, traditional or contemporary, I'm always happy to talk it through.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How I work</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">What to expect</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>First conversation</h3><p>Tell me what you have in mind by phone, WhatsApp or the enquiry form. Photos of the space are always helpful.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Site visit</h3><p>I'll come and see the room, take the measurements myself and talk through how you would like to use it.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Drawings &amp; a full price</h3><p>Hand drawings so you can picture the finished piece, and an itemised quotation so you know where you stand.</p></li>
      <li><h3>In the workshop</h3><p>Everything is made in Hebden Bridge, and I'm happy to send progress photos as the work comes together.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Fitting &amp; finishing</h3><p>I fit each piece myself and make sure everything is right before I hand it over.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="steps__note">{{ site.bookingNote }}</p>
